  {
    "id": "284581",
    "type": "tmdb",
    "title": "最强出涸皇子的暗跃帝位争夺 虽然对帝位没兴趣，但我不想死所以让我弟当皇帝吧",
    "posterPath": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etpSosywRvOO8mds61uv3aSjhDF.jpg",
    "releaseDate": "2026-07-06",
    "mediaType": "tv",
